Z||000000||NEFA||10-17-2001||11:41 AM||||NEFA is going to have a monthly Dinner. All Fiero owners are welcome to come.<P>We are going to have the 1st one at the HillTop steakhouse in Saugus MA.<BR>Please mark your calendars for Oct. 20th at 4:30PM.<P>We are hoping to get a nice large gathering and show our club pride. Hope to<BR>see lots of friends there.<P>Here is a link to driving directions and it also has a copy of the menu<BR>online <A HREF="http://www.hilltopsteakhouse.com/direction.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.hilltopsteakhouse.com/direction.html</A>  <P>P.S. you don't have to have your Fiero with you <BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/nefa_logo.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/calendar.htm" TARGET=_blank>Upcoming Club Events</A> <P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/tshirt.html" TARGET=_blank>Get your Club T-shirt</A>||||reg||2
